From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Apr 2026 04:37:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] .gitignore: exclude in-tree build dirs (build-macos,
 build-arm64ec)

Avoids GitHub Desktop / git status surfacing thousands of build artifacts
(.o, .a, .dll, .res) inside the submodule. Doesn't affect upstream Wine
since this is the willfaust/wine fork's ios-build branch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit e544ca5eda5118fdf470362d67ffaf4ab6133745)
Madeira-commit: ad47a3d01ca3230f87ef0e4afe621db671b63d9c
Rebased: clean
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 .gitignore | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitignore

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..96c96f5e75b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Local build directories — built artifacts (.o, .a, .dll, .res) end up here
+# and shouldn't be tracked. Wine recommends building out-of-tree but our
+# scripts use these in-tree paths.
+/build-macos/
+/build-arm64ec/
+
+# Other potential out-of-tree build dirs
+/build/
+/build-*/
